<class xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" name="FmodAudioPreviewProperty" inherits="ColorRect" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd">
	<brief_description>
		Custom property editor control for previewing FMOD audio streams in the editor.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		FmodAudioPreviewProperty provides a visual audio preview widget that displays in the Godot inspector when viewing [FmodAudioStream] resources. It features:
		- Visual waveform display
		- Play/pause/stop controls
		- Playback position indicator
		- Current time and duration display
		- Click-to-seek functionality on the waveform
		The preview is generated asynchronously to avoid blocking the editor.
	</description>
